# R2 on the GPU window (W4-WIN-CLOSE C2): an applied edit stays "not drawn" at the stage that is held,
# the window keeps drawing and the sim keeps applying commands, and the change becomes Visible only
# after the held stage is released and a presented frame draws it. Run with --gpu (a real window on
# the RTX 4090 adapter), with and without --trace. Every `expect` fails the session if not met.
look 1052 444
key b
select 1307
rotate 0
wait frames 90

# ---- baseline: with nothing held the edit is shown ---------------------------------------------
click 1052 444
wait outcome
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
checkpoint baseline_visible

# ---- the chunk builders are held: the object list is committed, the CPU chunks are not fresh ---
hold chunks
click 1068 444
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait blocked
wait frames 30
expect held chunks
expect visibility ChunksStale
checkpoint chunks_held
# Input and the sim progress meanwhile: a second edit is accepted and applied, still not drawn.
click 1076 444
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait frames 30
expect visibility ChunksStale
checkpoint chunks_held_second_edit
release chunks
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
checkpoint chunks_released

# ---- the uploads are held: the CPU chunks are fresh, the GPU copy is not the replacement -------
hold uploads
click 1084 444
wait outcome
wait visibility NotOnGpu
wait frames 30
expect held uploads
expect visibility NotOnGpu
checkpoint uploads_held
# Input and the sim progress while the replacement is held: another edit is accepted and applied.
click 1100 444
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait frames 20
expect visibility NotOnGpu
release uploads
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
checkpoint uploads_released

# ---- presents count as failed: everything is on the GPU, no successful present ------------------
hold presents
click 1092 444
wait outcome
wait visibility NotPresented
wait frames 20
expect held presents
expect visibility NotPresented
checkpoint presents_failing
release presents
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
checkpoint presents_ok
quit
